        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078150/extras/06cd19d9d40b0975a26a4accf0c9d32d.poster.avif?t=1766761237\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078150/extras/06cd19d9d40b0975a26a4accf0c9d32d.webm?t=1766761237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078150/extras/06cd19d9d40b0975a26a4accf0c9d32d.mp4?t=1766761237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi master !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm NEKO - your tiny typing buddy - a super fast keyboard companion !!! ദ്ദി/ᐠ｡‸｡ᐟ\\</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you type, I type along, working hard like a little cat in training. I don't just type for fun, I'm here to bring a bit of cuteness and energy to your workspace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep typing, and together we'll create every line, every idea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your keystroke are the beat of my heart, ♥ ♥ ♥</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ฅ^&gt;⩊&lt;^ ฅ</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an interactive keyboard simulation and decoration game. Your little cat Neko loves playing with the mechanical keyboard and small decorative items. Help Neko customize the keyboard and arrange the decorations around him in the most beautiful way possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078150/extras/649a3da890335e1afba24fccc03467c2.poster.avif?t=1766761237\" width=762 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078150/extras/649a3da890335e1afba24fccc03467c2.webm?t=1766761237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078150/extras/649a3da890335e1afba24fccc03467c2.mp4?t=1766761237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beside, you can create and upload your own decorations, including static or animated images. We look forward to your creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078150/extras/ff8ca98486d19d0e0e7ae134f03ff80d.avif?t=1766761237\" width=1537 height=578 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the keyboard, including its shape, color, and size.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the sound of each key press on the keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are hundreds of decorative items to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize and arrange the decorative items around it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and upload your own unique decorations to the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a representative character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you press any key, Neko will gain experience points to level up, unlocking new decorative items and features.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Important Notice]</strong><br>We only respond to game key requests sent from <strong>verified curator, press, or business email addresses</strong>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to an increasing number of impersonation and scam attempts, requests sent from free or unverifiable email addresses may not receive a response.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are a curator or content creator, please make sure your email address is clearly listed on your official Steam Curator page, website, or social media profile.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078150/extras/06cd19d9d40b0975a26a4accf0c9d32d.poster.avif?t=1766761237\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078150/extras/06cd19d9d40b0975a26a4accf0c9d32d.webm?t=1766761237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078150/extras/06cd19d9d40b0975a26a4accf0c9d32d.mp4?t=1766761237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi master !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm NEKO - your tiny typing buddy - a super fast keyboard companion !!! ദ്ദി/ᐠ｡‸｡ᐟ\\</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you type, I type along, working hard like a little cat in training. I don't just type for fun, I'm here to bring a bit of cuteness and energy to your workspace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep typing, and together we'll create every line, every idea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your keystroke are the beat of my heart, ♥ ♥ ♥</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ฅ^&gt;⩊&lt;^ ฅ</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an interactive keyboard simulation and decoration game. Your little cat Neko loves playing with the mechanical keyboard and small decorative items. Help Neko customize the keyboard and arrange the decorations around him in the most beautiful way possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078150/extras/649a3da890335e1afba24fccc03467c2.poster.avif?t=1766761237\" width=762 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078150/extras/649a3da890335e1afba24fccc03467c2.webm?t=1766761237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078150/extras/649a3da890335e1afba24fccc03467c2.mp4?t=1766761237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beside, you can create and upload your own decorations, including static or animated images. We look forward to your creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078150/extras/ff8ca98486d19d0e0e7ae134f03ff80d.avif?t=1766761237\" width=1537 height=578 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the keyboard, including its shape, color, and size.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the sound of each key press on the keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are hundreds of decorative items to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize and arrange the decorative items around it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and upload your own unique decorations to the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a representative character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you press any key, Neko will gain experience points to level up, unlocking new decorative items and features.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Important Notice]</strong><br>We only respond to game key requests sent from <strong>verified curator, press, or business email addresses</strong>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to an increasing number of impersonation and scam attempts, requests sent from free or unverifiable email addresses may not receive a response.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are a curator or content creator, please make sure your email address is clearly listed on your official Steam Curator page, website, or social media profile.</p>",
